WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.035
-Orlando and I are about to
face off in a water war.

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:04.838
We'll play the card game war,

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:08.475
but if you lose the hand, you
get a pint of water in the face.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:09.642
[ Laughter ]

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.544
We each have
five glasses of water.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:13.145
First one to throw all five wins

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:16.249
and gets to water-cannon
the loser.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.151
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:21.754
Lots of ways to get wet
but only one way to win.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.823
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.625
I have that tattooed
on my lower back.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.526
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:29.628
Orlando. Wait.
I'm sorry.

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:31.931
Wait, wait, sorry, no.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.300
That came out wrong.
Sorry.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.836
[ Speaks indistinctly ]

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:39.305
I was just --
I don't have that tattooed.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.574
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.243
Oh. Orlando, are you --
are you ready?

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:45.778
-I'm ready, I'm ready.
-All right. Here we go.

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.213
-Huh!
-Now, do you trust --

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.616
do you trust that these --
-No, I don't, actually, really.

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.084
-I mean, would you?
-What?

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.318
I've given you
before we start the game.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.619
-I'm going to roll with it,
though.

00:00:53.619 --> 00:00:54.920
I'm ready to go.
What do you wanna do?

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.755
You want to shuffle the deck?
-No. It's up to you.

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:58.357
Audience, you want me to shuffle
or leave it?

00:00:58.357 --> 00:00:59.425
[ Audience shouting ]

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:01.060
-Switch.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:05.064
Switch.
Oh, yeah, there you go.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.200
Anxious to -- Yeah.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.469
Yeah, baby, yeah, baby, yeah.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.871
-They don't know anything.
They don't work here.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.172
That's what I wanted you to do.

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:14.374
-Oh!
-Yeah!

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:15.608
-Have you seen
"The Princess Bride"?

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:20.813
Ah, so if I do this,
then I say we switch back.

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:22.214
-All right.

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:23.583
All right, here we go.
-All right. Ready?

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.851
-You ready?
-No, I'm not ready.

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:26.352
-All right, I'll go one --
-I'm actually nervous.

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.921
-One, two, three.
Then you flip.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.455
-Okay. One, two, three.
-Wait, wait, wait.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.490
Just move the first card
over here over the line.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:32.992
Now we do one, two, three,
and flip it over.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.795
Ready? One, two, three.
-One, two, three.

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:38.264
-Yeah!
-Oh!

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.066
Who said flip the cards?

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.034
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:43.402
Oh, my.

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:45.104
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:47.173
I'm in my happy place.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.411
It's good.
-It's good?

00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:54.246
Oh, this is great already.
-I'm awake.

00:01:54.246 --> 00:01:56.215
-This is great already.
-Okay.

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:57.850
-Now, you still have time
to switch the deck

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.853
if you really want.
-Okay. I'm ready.

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.253
-Do you want to switch the deck?

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:04.323
-No! And, like, now you're
going to whip me, aren't you?

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:08.628
-Here we go.
One, two, three, flip.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.096
-Yeah!

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.264
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:12.999
-Be nice, be nice.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.402
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.905 --> 00:02:21.875
-That is a threesome.

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.610
-Three out of the same cup.

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.077
All right, now it's game on.
now it's war!

00:02:25.077 --> 00:02:26.346
-Ready!

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:29.115
One, two, three.
-One, two, three. Flip.

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:31.184
Damn it!
-Yeah!

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:34.787
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.722
One, two --

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:38.057
I feel like that --
I feel like --

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:39.925
What's that film with
Christopher Walken

00:02:39.925 --> 00:02:41.894
where it's the gun
sitting on head?

00:02:41.894 --> 00:02:43.763
You know the one I mean?
Anyway, yeah.

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:46.232
One, two, three.
-One, two, three. Flip.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.700
Yeah!
-Oh!

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.835
-Oh, man, I love you, dude.

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:51.137
-Ah!

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:53.573
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.208
All right, ready?

00:02:56.208 --> 00:02:59.945
-One, two, three.
-One, two, three.

00:02:59.945 --> 00:03:01.214
-War!
-War!

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.781
-This is war.
Now, here's what happens.

00:03:02.781 --> 00:03:03.916
Ready?
-All right, ready.

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:05.952
-We'll dole out three cards
here.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:07.453
One, two, three.

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.722
And then we pour a cup
into this pitcher here.

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:13.760
Here we go. One, two, three.
-I got one. One, two, three.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:17.930
Yeah!

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:19.232
Yeah, maybe.

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:21.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:28.941 --> 00:03:30.276
Wait, do I get a gun, too?

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:33.579
Oh! I was like,
"Give me the gun."

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:35.881
[ Laughs ]

00:03:35.881 --> 00:03:38.884
Notice I went for
the down-the-back action, too.

00:03:38.884 --> 00:03:40.687
A little bit of
down-the-back action.

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.888
-And it's cold, too.
All right, here we go.

00:03:42.888 --> 00:03:44.524
Oh, God.
-Here we go, baby.

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:46.592
-Why do we play this game?
-Now we'll switch the cards.

00:03:46.592 --> 00:03:48.961
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.961 --> 00:03:50.696
-One, two -- Come on!

00:03:50.696 --> 00:03:51.831
-Oh!

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:53.800
-No!
-Ace!

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.268
Aces win!
-Stop getting that.

00:03:56.268 --> 00:03:58.805
-Oh! Oh.

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:01.207
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.207 --> 00:04:02.942
There.

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:04.910
-This game's longer
than I remember it being.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:07.513
All right. One, two --

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:10.983
-Yes!

00:04:10.983 --> 00:04:12.718
I love you.

00:04:12.718 --> 00:04:13.786
Now it's this.

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:15.320
-No, now you get the cannon.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.123
-Now I get the cannon.

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:19.726
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:27.766
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.766 --> 00:04:29.435
-Orlando Bloom, everybody.

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:32.838
Check out "Carnival Row"
on Amazon Prime Video.

00:04:32.838 --> 00:04:35.274
Constance Wu joins us
after the break.

00:04:35.274 --> 00:04:37.076
-I love it.

